codex
The smoke matched only because the DUT stopped on an illegal at `pc=0x0000000a`, which is not the final `ebreak`; that is exactly the kind of false green the goal warns against. I’m tightening the TB so only the explicit `ebreak` sentinel is a normal stop, and the runner will compare one extra Spike commit so early illegal stops become real divergences.
