+## divergence
+Seed 2026060801. DUT flagged illegal before sentinel ebreak at pc=0x0000000a instr=0x00000f97 (AUIPC x31,0). Spike retired AUIPC and next ADDI at pc=0x0000000e instr=0x00cf8f93 rd=x31 wdata=0x00000016. Repro: flow/v2_pipeline/phase_03_09_riscvdv_lockstep/runs/seed_2026060801 and divergence/seed_2026060801_divergence.json.
+
+## isa_config
