+## summary
+DIVERGENCE-FOUND: total matched commits = 0 / 100000 target; seeds completed = 1 attempted, 0 passed.
+
+## divergence
+Seed 2026060801. DUT flagged illegal before sentinel ebreak at pc=0x0000000a instr=0x00000f97 (AUIPC x31,0). Spike retired AUIPC and next ADDI at pc=0x0000000e instr=0x00cf8f93 rd=x31 wdata=0x00000016. Repro: flow/v2_pipeline/phase_03_09_riscvdv_lockstep/runs/seed_2026060801 and divergence/seed_2026060801_divergence.json.
+
+## isa_config
+riscv-dv pyflow target rv32imc, gcc -march=rv32imc_zicsr_zifencei -mabi=ilp32, M-mode bare program. Excluded unsupported/randomized behavior with --no_load_store=1 --no_branch_jump=1 --no_csr_instr=1 --no_fence=1 --no_data_page=1 --no_ebreak=1; no A/F/D/V.
+
+## throughput
+Verilator. J8 stopped on first real divergence after 12.83 sec; 0 matched commits/sec because no complete seed matched. DUT trace had 4 commits before illegal; Spike had 5 comparable commits.
+
+## files_added
+flow/v2_pipeline/phase_03_09_riscvdv_lockstep/{run_riscvdv_lockstep.py,tb_riscvdv_lockstep.v,firmware.lds,config/m1_riscvdv/testlist.yaml,config/m1_riscvdv/riscv_core_setting.sv,riscvdv_lockstep_summary.json,runs/,divergence/}; tests/gates/gate_03_09_riscvdv_lockstep.py.
+
+## provenance
+riscv-dv /home/edauser/project/SOC/Magpie_X6/vendored/riscv-dv rev 80e7a007d4d95ec2ed70fe4716e1217076f24ecb. gcc: riscv-none-elf-gcc 13.2.0. Spike: /home/edauser/.local/bin/spike 1.1.1-dev. Command: ./run_riscvdv_lockstep.py --start-seed 2026060801 --seeds 25 --instr-cnt 4000 --target-commits 100000 --max-cycles 2000000.
+
+## gate_status
+pytest -q tests/gates/gate_03_09_riscvdv_lockstep.py tests/gates/gate_03_08_lockstep_revalidate.py PASS: 4 passed. gate_03_09 documents DIVERGENCE-FOUND, not a 100k PASS.
+
+## tokens
